import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.PeriodFamilyHolomorphicCohomologyFourierHermitianSmooth

/-!
# Smooth Hermitian contraction of the genuine two-component symbol

This module supplies the explicit Hermitian inverses, their symbol equations,
the full contracting-homotopy identity, complex-linear operator bundles, and
order-minus-one norm estimates in the original finite-product norm. Both
inverse formulas depend jointly real smoothly on their symbol and coefficient
away from the zero symbol.

No choice of a maximal coordinate is made. Application to varying periods,
locally uniform elliptic bounds, and convergence of Fourier series belong to
the separate period-family files.
-/
